{"name":"Chethel","status":"ok","title":"Chethel","pageId":48644,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Chethel\" title=\"Category:Maps of Chethel\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Chethel</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p196_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p196-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Settlement</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luiren\" title=\"Luiren\">Luiren</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Southeast_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Southeast Faerûn\">Southeast Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Large city</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p196_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p196-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halflings</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Elf\" title=\"Elf\">elves</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Half-elf\" title=\"Half-elf\">half-elves</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"established\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Established</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">47</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15,512 in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Chethel\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Chethel\">Inhabitants of  Chethel</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6TG9jYXRpb25zX2luX0NoZXRoZWw/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Category:Locations in Chethel (page does not exist)\">Locations in  Chethel</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9DaGV0aGVsP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Chethel (page does not exist)\">Organizations in  Chethel</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Chethel&amp;DPL_cat2=Roads&amp;action=purge\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Roads  in  Chethel</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6RXZlbnRzX2luX0NoZXRoZWw/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Category:Events in Chethel (page does not exist)\">Events in  Chethel</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a class=\"newcategory\" href=\"/wiki/Category:Food_and_drink_from_Chethel\" title=\"Category:Food and drink from Chethel\">Food and drink from  Chethel</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SXRlbXNfZnJvbV9DaGV0aGVsP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Category:Items from Chethel (page does not exist)\">Items from  Chethel</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Chethel</b> was a coastal city in the <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">halfling</a> realm of <a href=\"/wiki/Luiren\" title=\"Luiren\">Luiren</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p196_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p196-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chethel?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Chethel was located on the coast of <a href=\"/wiki/Luirenstrand\" title=\"Luirenstrand\">Luirenstrand</a> (the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Sea\" title=\"Great Sea\">Great Sea</a>). Directly to the southeast of the city was the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Mortick_Swamp\" title=\"Mortick Swamp\">Mortick Swamp</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-Map-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chethel?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The city was founded in <a href=\"/wiki/47_DR\" title=\"47 DR\">47 DR</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-tGHotR-p61_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tGHotR-p61-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> In <a href=\"/wiki/148_DR\" title=\"148 DR\">148 DR</a>, the city was half-destroyed by <a href=\"/wiki/Merrow_(ogre)\" title=\"Merrow (ogre)\">merrow</a> from Mortick Swamp.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-tGHotR-p63_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tGHotR-p63-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> In <a href=\"/wiki/1105_DR\" title=\"1105 DR\">1105 DR</a>, the city received widespread damage from a storm over the Great Sea.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-GHR-119_5-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GHR-119-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chethel?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Chethel was one of Luiren's main trading cities. Its inhabitants were particularly skilled at shipbuilding.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p196_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p196-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chethel?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In addition to halflings, one-tenth of the city's population were <a href=\"/wiki/Elf\" title=\"Elf\">elves</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Half-elf\" title=\"Half-elf\">half-elves</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p196_1-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p196-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chethel?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCS3e-p196-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p196_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p196_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p196_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p196_1-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p196_1-4\">1.4</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skip_Williams\" title=\"Skip Williams\">Skip Williams</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rob_Heinsoo\" title=\"Rob Heinsoo\">Rob Heinsoo</a> (June 2001). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Setting_3rd_edition\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition\">Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the